OL,3,GNEWSACouncil leader to challenge party
OL,4,Abosses over NPR
OL,5,
OL,6,FBradford's Reform UK council leader
OL,7,Fsaid he hoped to change his party's
OL,8,Fmind over its opposition to the
OL,9,FNorthern Powerhouse Rail (NPR) project.
OL,11,FStephen Place said he was willing to
OL,12,Fmake the case for the flagship rail
OL,13,Fscheme to Reform's national leadership,
OL,14,Fdespite deputy leader Richard Tice
OL,15,Fpreviously saying his party would scrap
OL,16,Fit if the party came to power.
OL,18,FOn Tuesday, the government confirmed a
OL,19,Fnew station is set to be built at
OL,20,FBradford Interchange as part of the NPR
OL,21,Fproject.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
